- @page_title = "Join the Team"
.container
  %h1.title= @page_title
  .row
    .span8
      %p Action.IO is revolutionizing the way the the world develops software applications. We are looking for remarkable people to help us effect the next paradigm shift in programming.
      %p Action.IO was founded in July of 2012 and has offices in San Francisco and Singapore.

      %hr

      %article#jobs
        #jpost
          %h3 Dev Ops Engineer
          %p The Action.IO platform engineering team works on the infrastructure as well as associated tools which power our cutting-edge cloud development platform.
          %p We are looking for talented engineers who are passionate about building fault-tolerant distributed systems, automating configuration and deployment, and bringing about a level of security to our deployment process which will enable our application teams to deploy features at a quick and consistent rate.

          %h4 Responsibilities
          %p.reqs
            %ul
              %li Implement internal tools such as monitoring, analytics and automated backup in the form of services
              %li Be responsible for the uptime of customer-facing services
              %li Design and lead infrastructure failure simulations and implement corrective measures
              %li Benchmark app performance and design scalable and performant systems and APIs

          %h4 Technologies
          %p You'll have worked with these or similar technologies:
          %p.reqs
            %ul
              %li Ruby/Python/Node.JS/Go
              %li Amazon Web Services (EC2, ELB, S3 in multiple regions)
              %li Ansible/Chef/Puppet (or a configuration management system of your choice)
              %li Vagrant
              %li Monit/Nagios/Sensu
              %li CollectD/Diamond/Riemann
              %li Graphite
              %li Logstash
              %li StatsD
              %li Git
              %li Nginx/HAProxy
              %li Redis/PostgreSQL

          %p.actions
            To apply, please send the following to
            =mail_to 'jobs@action.io', 'jobs@action.io', encode: 'javascript'

            %p.reqs
              %ul
                %li Resume
                %li Github Profile
                %li Code snippets that you think best represent your coding style
                %li Examples of ways you communicate online: Mailing list discussions, StackOverflow answers, Twitter profile, blog, etc.
                %li Links to side/hobby projects that you have built

    .span3.offset1
      #sidebar
        %h3 About Action.IO
        %p
          Employees receive equity, health insurance, gym memberships, beers stocked in the office, exercise balls, the laptop of your choice, the chair of your choice, and a bike or a monthly public transportation stipend.
        %h3 Action Perks
        %p
          %ul
            %li Relocation costs covered
            %li Equity in a fast growing startup
            %li Beer (or Juice) Fridays
            %li Hipster Fixed-gear Bike
            %li Gym Stipend
            %li Latest Apple Laptop
            %li Weekly Company Hackathons
        %h3 Open Positions
        %ul
          %li=link_to 'Dev Ops Engineer', jobs_path
